WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:00.900
Hey, how's it going, bros?

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.460
My name is PewDiePie!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.580
You can hold your celebrations. I'm not going away forever,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.380
just yet.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.320
I'm just going away for another trip, and I've decided, not to upload during this time.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.320
Because my hair is just so god-damn awful.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.920
I'm looks like Demitri trying sell sweatpants.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.200
Usually when I go away, I prepare videos in advance.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.220
it's a lot of work,

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.440
but we make it happen. But this time, it just felt…forced

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.600
I don't want to put…

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.520
quantity over quality.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.120
Never thought I'd say that.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.200
I feel so weird.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.300
I feel so…ugh.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.920
Quantity wins on YouTube. That's…

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.200
like no question.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.080
Look at Leafy Is Here, okay?

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.080
[Quiet chuckle]

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.800
I'm kidding, Calvin. (Leafy's real name)
[blows kiss twice]

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.720
Last year when I prepared for scare PewPiePie, I made so many videos in advance, because I knew I was gonna be away for a month.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.540
And…I really hated that,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.320
because…

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.920
I made videos that I didn't like…

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.020
because I had to make them,

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:00.300
and…

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.420
just…wasn't fun.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:10.240
And now I feel finally really happy about the content that I'm making, and I want to stay true to that. So, no more shit content!

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:18.240
That's the funniest joke of this video. I haven't taken a break like this from YouTube in probably two years. So it's a little scary,

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.540
and you don't know what's gonna happen, but we're just gonna have to go with it.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.380
If you will…if…please be back cause I will be back as well.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:27.300
Thank you!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.920
I love you guys so much!

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.560
I hope you guys understand this decision.
[Turn around and hit microphone]

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.520
It's just the way the…

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.860
It's gonna go from…thank you for understanding this decision.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.440
The feedback I've been getting lately on the channel has just been…

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.680
fucking amazing! (hell yeah it has)

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.940
And I wanna keep that up, and I think this is the best way to do it.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:48.340
So I'll see you in *seven days*
[echoes in asterisks]

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.000
Have a great time until then, and remember bros:

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.240
[Kisses fist] Stay awesome!

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.800
